# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# A crash on purpose, for the crash reporter: the Watch application opened (its NTKFaceSnapshotService aborts, a few
# times), then closed. With ALLOW="ReportCrash osanalytics" in the build's environment; the host then asks for the
# reports (idevicecrashreport -k DIR).
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 30 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 8
/redwood/bin/lsreg -o com.apple.Bridge
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 20 button home wait 5
